:''This article's name is not official.''
'''Finale Base''' is a [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] [[Enemy Bases|enemy base]] that appears in the [[Neon Genesis Evangelion Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 12.4 Update|Version 12.4]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Finale Base
|image = E 651.png
|first appearance = [[Neon Genesis Evangelion Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = N/A
}}

==Enemy==
The Finale Base is a harmless three-seated bench with [[Shinji & Cat (Rare Cat)|Shinji]] sitting upon it, looking off into the distance. It does nothing despite its special treatment as an animated base, so even a [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Cat]] can destroy it without difficulty.

