==Trivia==
*The Finale Base is the only enemy base that is traited as [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] rather than [[:Category:Typeless Enemies|Typeless]].
*Because of the restriction in [[Finale]] locking out all [[:Category:Cats with Weaken ability|cats with Weaken abilities]], there is no way for the Finale Base to demonstrate its weaken immunity in-game; the other immunities can at least block effects from the different [[Cat Cannon]]s.
*Curiously, unlike other recently-introduced [[:Category:Animated Enemy Bases|animated Bases]], the Finale Base is not immune to [[Surge Attack|Surges]].

